<title>AUSTRIA: TENNIS-AUSTRIA LEAD CROATIA 2-1 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-AUSTRIA LEAD CROATIA 2-1 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>GRAZ, Austria 1997-04-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austria led Croatia 2-1 in their Davis Cup European/African zone group one second round tie despite losing the doubles on Saturday.</p>
<p>Result:</p>
<p>Goran Ivanisevic/Sasa Hirszon (Croatia) beat Thomas Muster/Udo Plamberger (Austria) 7-5 6-2 6-2</p>
